OL,3,ASam Fender calls out ticket prices
OL,4,Aahead of tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Geordie musician also said standing
OL,7,Fwould not be split into a front and
OL,8,Fback tier and he had "no idea how this
OL,9,Fwas normalised at gigs".
